"In 2015, the UN set 17 goals to make the world better by 2030. They are the "
"Sustainable Development Goals, and your invention can help achieve one of them!"

msgid "Escolha uma ODS que importa para você e transforme-a em uma invenção."
msgstr "Pick an SDG that matters to you and turn it into an invention."

